{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/23/7653858/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山のコメントありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/23/7653858/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ元気もらいました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/23/7653858/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島に帰ったて東京きたって沢山私にはファミリーがいます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/23/7653858/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/23/7653858/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂ふぁむ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/23/7653858/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかあったらふぁむにそうだんするもん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/23/7653858/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/23/7653858/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/23/7653858/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも毎日家族や友達に今日あったことを日記にしてMailしようかなぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/23/7653858/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまには電話もありだよね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/23/7653858/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/23/7653858/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/23/7653858/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/23/7653858/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てかさぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/23/7653858/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もぅめっちゃ私の周りの人は私を泣かせるのがうまいねっ(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントてかでなかされてさぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/23/7653858/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんとこまっちゃうよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/23/7653858/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おしおきだぁぁぁい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/23/7653858/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/23/7653858/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なぁんってねっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/23/7653858/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てかさぁ最近の携帯はほんとすごいねぇ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/23/7653858/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アプリがすごい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/23/7653858/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真機能とか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/23/7653858/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私のは文字しか合成できないし"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/23/7653858/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/23/7653858/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんとついてけないねっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/23/7653858/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/23/7653858/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前ねぇコップにお茶入れようと思ってコップだしたの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/23/7653858/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それで気づいたらコップにドレッシングかけてたの〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/23/7653858/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/23/7653858/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お茶とドレッシングまちがえたの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/23/7653858/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嘘だとおもう？ほんとだよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/23/7653858/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆様もきおつけてねっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/23/7653858/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Bye"}],"source":"archive"}